  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1 distinguishes ShopeeOrderStatus.Unpaid from Pending. orderStatus UNPAID maps to Unpaid (appended as value 7); PENDING stays Pending. ShopeeConversionStatusFilter.Unpaid sends orderStatus UNPAID. Sales-summary totals still include every conversion; ByStatus counts Unpaid and Pending separately. Previously published enum values 0 through 6 are unchanged.",
